<title>USA: LSB raises payout, to issue stock dividend.</title>
<headline>LSB raises payout, to issue stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, Ind. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>LSB Financial Corp said Wednesday it was raising its cash dividend and will issue a five percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The quarterly cash dividend was raised to $0.085 a share from $0.08 and is payable June 2 to shareholders of record May 16, the thrift holding company said.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be paid June 30 to sharehodlers of record June 3, the company said.</p>
<p>LSB shares rose 3/4 to 20-3/4 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
